l documents suit close observation of local craftsmanship; there is no information confirming whether all of them can be seen from outside. Boat parts that sources say are kept in the temple grounds link the site to the town’s waterborne goods transport. No latest condition check is available for 2026 (พ.ศ. 2569).\"}}]}]",
